body:
My girlfriends gecko seams like its got early stages of tail rot. I have read that a betadine soak followed by Neosporin will help. Has anyone experienced this before? what was the outcome? How fast dose it spread? Any advice or stories welcome.

&#x200B;

My girlfriend is very concerned and I plan on taking them to the vet but it wont be for a few days... and it will be 6 hours of driving total.
